    in taproom
    cost 50
    seats 3
    model bar_straight_A bottle_A_green:0.15:-0.02:0:1:0.25 bottle_C_brown:-0.12:0:0:1:0.25
    text Ale for the thirsty, and best ale once the brewhouse is brewing.
end

unit table
