    text Old pots, bones and coins from the fields round the village, labelled: a look for the
    text bored. With a reading desk and a bookcase near, the Archaeological Society meets here.
end

unit mashtun
    name Mash tun
    in brewhouse
    cost 80
    seats 0
    model barrel_large_decorated:-0.12:-0.08:0:0.9 village/sack:0.3:0.25:30:0.8 village/sack:0.32:-0.22:0:0.8
    text Brews best ale from well water and malt, at evening, for a little silver.
end

unit maypole
    name Maypole
    in yard
    cost 150
    seats 0
    model post:0:0:0:1.5 banner_shield_green:0:0.04:0:0.55:0.85 village/flower-red:-0.18:0.12:0:1:0.05 village/flower-yellow:0.18:0.12:0:1:0.05 village/flower-purple:0:-0.18:0:1:0.05
    text Ribbons and a crown of flowers: a great deal of cheer round it. A stage within two cells
    text means dancing on the green. Needs a maypole (the market).
end

# ---------- services ----------
# A unit gives the first service listed here that meets the guest's need and that it can give.

service bestale
    name A mug of best ale
    at bar
    need Thirst 80
    global BestAle in 1
    price 6
    time 6
    map Noise out 2 radius 1
end

service ale
    name A mug of ale
    at bar
    need Thirst 60
    global Ale in 1
    price 3
    time 4
    map Noise out 3 radius 1
end

service pie
    name A slice of pie
    at table
    need Hunger 90
    global Pies in 1
    price 7
    time 10
    map Noise out 1
end

service stew
    name A bowl of stew
    at table
    need Hunger 70
    global Stew in 1
    price 5
    time 8
    map Noise out 1
end

service pallet
    name A pallet in the hayloft
    at pallet
    need Rest 80
    price 3
    time 45
end

service bed
    name Half a bed
    at bed
    need Rest 90
    price 6
    time 50
end

service featherbed
    name A feather bed
    at featherbed
    need Rest 100
    price 10
    time 40
end

service rinse
    name A wash at the basin
    at washstand
    need Grime 45
    price 2
    time 6
    map Dirt out 0.5
end

service soak
    name A hot soak
    at tub
    need Grime 90
    global HotWater in 1
    price 7
    time 25
end

service song
    name A song
    at stage
    need Boredom 65
    price 3
    time 20
    map Noise out 1.5 radius 1
    map Cheer out 1 radius 1
end

service skittles
    name A game of skittles
    at skittles
    need Boredom 60
    price 4
    time 18
    map Noise out 2 radius 1
end

service draughts
    name A game of draughts
    at draughts
    need Boredom 85
    price 7
    time 25
    map Noise out 0.5
end

service read
    name A quiet read
    at desk
    need Boredom 75
    price 5
    time 30
end

service curios
    name A look at the curiosities
    at curios
    need Boredom 65
    price 5
    time 15
end

service prayer
    name A prayer
    at altar
    need Prayer 80
    price 3
    time 20
end

service remount
    name A fresh horse
    at posthorse
    need Horse 100
    global Fodder in 1
    price 14
    time 4
end

service stabling
    name Stabling for the night
    at stall
    need Horse 90
    global Fodder in 1
    price 5
    time 6
    map Muck out 2 radius 1
end

service watering
    name A drink at the trough
    at trough
    need Mule 70
    price 1
    time 4
    map Dirt out 0.3
end

# ---------- combos: furniture that works better together ----------
# `near` counts units within a radius on the same level (diagonals count). Effects multiply the
# services at the unit (`price`, `relief`, `time`) or add to the served guest's mood.

combo fireside
    name Fireside
    text A table within two cells of the fire pit: pies and stew a fifth dearer, and guests warm
    text to the place.
    at table
    near fire 2
    price 1.2
    mood 0.05
    map Cheer out 0.2 radius 1
end

combo regulars
    name Regulars' row
    text Stools beside the bar: drinks go down a quarter faster, and a little dearer.
    at bar
    near stool 1
    price 1.1
    time 0.75
end

combo ovenfresh
    name Fresh from the oven
    text A table within two cells of the bread oven: the pies come hot, and fill a fifth more.
    at table
    near oven 2
    relief 1.2
    mood 0.03
end

combo colours
    name Under the colours
    text A table beside a garrison banner: soldiers drink to the king, and order a little more.
    at table
    near banner 1
    price 1.1
    mood 0.04
end

combo singsong
    name Sing-song
    text A bar within two cells of a minstrels' stage: the whole room joins in. Drinks dearer and
    text quicker, and the word spreads (renown at the market).
    at bar
    near stage 2
    price 1.15
    time 0.8
    mood 0.05
    map Cheer out 0.3 radius 2
end

combo vespers
    name Lit prayers
    text Two lanterns or candle stands beside the prayer corner: deeper prayers, and the room
    text glows.
    at altar
    near lantern,candles 1 2
    relief 1.3
    mood 0.1
    map Cheer out 0.4 radius 2
end

combo congregation
    name Full pews
    text Two pews beside the prayer corner and an alms box (the market): the faithful give half as
    text much again.
    at altar
    near pew 1 2
    price 1.5
end

combo blessed
    name A blessed house
    text Once the parson has blessed the house (the market), a prayer corner is dearer, deeper and
    text bright.
    at altar
    if global Blessed atLeast 1
    price 1.25
    relief 1.2
    map Cheer out 0.8 radius 2
end

combo steam
    name Steam room
    text A tub beside the copper, in a warm room (warmth 3 or more): soaks take less time, and
    text everyone comes out pink and pleased.
    at tub
    near copper 1
    if map Warmth atLeast 3
    time 0.7
    mood 0.08
end

combo herbbath
    name Herb bath
    text A tub beside strewing herbs: lavender in the water. A fifth more relief, and happier
    text bathers.
    at tub
    near strewing 1
    relief 1.2
    mood 0.06
end

combo quiet
    name Quiet corner
    text A reading desk with two bookcases beside it, where the noise is under 3: a deeper read
    text and a happier reader.
    at desk
    near bookcase 1 2
    if map Noise less 3
    relief 1.3
    mood 0.1
end

combo alley
    name Skittle alley
    text Two skittle lanes side by side draw a crowd: dearer games, merrier players, and more
    text noise.
    at skittles
    near skittles 1
    price 1.15
    mood 0.05
    map Noise out 1 radius 1
end

combo wagers
    name Wagers on the board
    text A draughts table once the inn's reputation is 40 or more: the wagers go up by half.
    at draughts
    if global Reputation atLeast 40
    price 1.5
end

combo groomed
    name A well-kept stable
    text A stall or the post horses beside a stable lad's barrow: horses seen to faster, and a
    text fifth dearer.
    at stall posthorse
    near barrow 1
    price 1.2
    time 0.7
    mood 0.05
end

combo posting
    name Posting house
    text Post horses with a horse stall and a hayrick within two cells: the king's messengers pay a
    text third more, and spread the word (renown at the market).
    at posthorse
    near stall 2
    near hayrick 2
    price 1.3
    mood 0.08
end

combo quietbed
    name A quiet night
    text A shared bed or a feather bed where the noise is under 2: a deeper sleep.
    at bed featherbed
    if map Noise less 2
    relief 1.2
    mood 0.08
end

combo cosy
    name Cosy corner
    text A bed or pallets beside a flower tub or a lantern: guests settle in.
    at bed featherbed pallet
    near flowers,lantern 1
    mood 0.06
    map Cheer out 0.15
end

combo society
    name The Archaeological Society
    text A cabinet of curiosities with a reading desk and a bookcase within two cells, once the
    text Society has its charter (the market): members meet over the finds. Dearer, merrier, and
    text renown and tales.
    at curios
    near desk 2
    near bookcase 2
    price 1.5
    relief 1.25
    mood 0.1
    map Cheer out 0.4 radius 2
end

combo dancing
    name Dancing on the green
    text A minstrels' stage within two cells of the maypole: the whole village dances. Songs half
    text as dear again, and a great deal of cheer.
    at stage
    near maypole 2
    price 1.5
    relief 1.3
    mood 0.1
    map Cheer out 0.6 radius 2
end

